{"unit_id":"seolhw__dsh-guild#feature-1","repo":"seolhw/dsh-guild","commit":"94d86de51b42cbd6ba402702cd91a541048881f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Guild 的功能「社区消息搜索」：DSH-Guild 的社区消息搜索可按关键词查找正文，并可限定频道、作者、起止时间或只看提及自己的消息；结果支持游标分页。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/client/src/server.ts:940-975"]}
