{"unit_id":"seolhw__dsh-guild#feature-3","repo":"seolhw/dsh-guild","commit":"94d86de51b42cbd6ba402702cd91a541048881f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Guild 的功能「分享与克隆会话」：DSH-Guild 可把本机 DSH 会话打包并分享给社区成员；对方可查看分享详情并将会话克隆到自己的本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/host/src/index.ts:320-350"]}
{"unit_id":"seolhw__dsh-guild#feature-4","repo":"seolhw/dsh-guild","commit":"94d86de51b42cbd6ba402702cd91a541048881f3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Guild 的功能「实时社区连接」：DSH-Guild 的社区界面使用 WebSocket 收发实时事件，并按服务端提供的间隔发送心跳；连接关闭时停止心跳。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/client/src/ws.ts:28-73"]}
